{"id":"n71229-1-12","stage":3,"title":"저축 · 储蓄","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71229-1-12-1","ko":"네가 무슨 돈이 있다고. 이 큰돈을 어디서 구했니?","zh":"你哪来这么多钱啊？这笔大钱是从哪儿弄来的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"3","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"돈이","meaning":"钱，钱财","explanation":"돈：钱，钱财；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"3","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돈이","audio":"/audio/6fc43b50168ec9dd1ba6.mp3"}},{"text":"있다고.","meaning":"富有，宽裕","explanation":"있다：富有，宽裕；다고：重复、强调或确认所说的内容；带 요 时为礼貌表达。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"4","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있다고","audio":"/audio/4df9048dde2a8a3e535d.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"큰돈을","meaning":"大，巨大；钱，钱财","explanation":"크다：大，巨大；돈：钱，钱财；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"},{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"5","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"3","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"큰돈을","audio":"/audio/aaa8c2bc48e27c8cd6f0.mp3"}},{"text":"어디서","meaning":"哪里、哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里、哪儿；서：에서 的缩略，表示动作地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디서","audio":"/audio/2239e13aeeae3639dd35.mp3"}},{"text":"구했니?","meaning":"找，弄，求","explanation":"구하다：找，弄，求；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"구하다","audio":"/audio/288eb4bbfc0c27cc5bf6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58299","senseId":"1","lemma":"구하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"구했니","audio":"/audio/cbc04dda41b44a8b1068.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于强调预料之外的、不合理的事情。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"a5d79d1c30059080","term":"돈","zh":"钱，钱财","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3","entryId":"17204","definition":"财物或财产。","pronunciation":["돈ː"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"富有，宽裕","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"财产充足、充裕。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"大，巨大","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"钱的数额很多或数量单位很高。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里、哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"哪里、哪儿","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"288eb4bbfc0c27cc","term":"구하다","zh":"找，弄，求","audio":"/audio/288eb4bbfc0c27cc5bf6.mp3","entryId":"58299","definition":"为得到需要的东西而寻找；或指寻找以求得到。","pronunciation":["구하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/374e40a9cca353427d24.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71229-1-12-2","ko":"틈틈이 저축을 한 돈이에요.","zh":"是我一点点攒下来的钱哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"틈틈이","meaning":"一有空，每当有空","explanation":"틈틈이：一有空，每当有空","readings":[{"term":"틈틈이","audio":"/audio/4cf88e8c2b63a0e83ac5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82656","senseId":"2","lemma":"틈틈이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"틈틈이","audio":"/audio/4cf88e8c2b63a0e83ac5.mp3"}},{"text":"저축을","meaning":"储蓄，积蓄，存款","explanation":"저축：储蓄，积蓄，存款；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"저축","audio":"/audio/7b943d7a00cb39bff616.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71229","senseId":"1","lemma":"저축","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저축을","audio":"/audio/0d07d202aa341d286b4e.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"做，作，置办","explanation":"하다：做，作，置办；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"돈이에요.","meaning":"钱，钱财","explanation":"돈：钱，钱财；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"3","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돈이에요","audio":"/audio/528f3649ded4a9efc824.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4cf88e8c2b63a0e8","term":"틈틈이","zh":"一有空，每当有空","audio":"/audio/4cf88e8c2b63a0e83ac5.mp3","entryId":"82656","definition":"每当时间充裕时。","pronunciation":["틈트미"]},{"id":"7b943d7a00cb39bf","term":"저축","zh":"储蓄，积蓄，存款","audio":"/audio/7b943d7a00cb39bff616.